#: src/main.ui:73
msgid ""
"Snapshots of your face that Ubuntu Hello compares against. Keep at least "
"two, recorded in different lighting."
msgstr ""
"Potret wajah Anda yang Ubuntu Hello bandingkan. Simpan setidaknya dua, "
"direkam dalam pencahayaan berbeda."

#: src/main.ui:95
msgid "Showing saved models for:"
msgstr "Menampilkan model tersimpan untuk:"

#: src/main.ui:135
msgid ""
"Only one face model is enrolled. Lighting changes how your face looks to the "
"camera, so a single model can fail in the evening under lamps (or in "
"daylight). Add a second model recorded in different light to keep unlocking "
"reliable at any time of day."
msgstr ""
"Hanya satu model wajah yang terdaftar. Pencahayaan mengubah tampilan wajah "
"Anda di mata kamera, sehingga satu model bisa gagal di malam hari di bawah "
"lampu (atau di siang hari). Tambahkan model kedua yang direkam dalam cahaya "
"berbeda agar pembukaan kunci tetap dapat diandalkan kapan saja sepanjang "
"hari."

#: src/main.ui:144
msgid "Add a second model"
msgstr "Tambahkan model kedua"

